","HTML source","bounding boxes","instructions"],"notes":"The card metadata gives split sizes for the desktop and web configurations only; the mobile configuration's sizes appear only as the prose figure of 10.5K. The prose figures for desktop (16.6K) and web (10.2K) differ slightly from the metadata split totals (16,488 and 10,086). Each element carries a name, five intents and center/size coordinates; the card reports an average of 54 annotated elements per image. Annotations are LLM-generated and were not human-verified by this review.","splits":["desktop train","desktop validation","mobile train","mobile validation","web train","web validation"],"supervision":["synthetic GUI element annotations","element names","natural-language interaction intents"]},"disabled":false,"download_url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/MolmoPoint-GUISyn/tree/24bb3e990bb1e48796d80ade9dbc858dda695e75","gated":false,"hub_id":"allenai/MolmoPoint-GUISyn","hub_revision":"24bb3e990bb1e48796d80ade9dbc858dda695e75","license_review":{"data":{"evidence_urls":["https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/MolmoPoint-GUISyn/raw/24bb3e990bb1e48796d80ade9dbc858dda695e75/README.md"],"reason":"Conflicting declarations in the same card: the metadata header declares Apache-2.0, while the License section declares ODC-BY and adds that Claude-generated screenshots are subject to Anthropic's terms. The GitHub code license does not resolve the data terms."}},"repository_url":"https://github.com/allenai/MolmoPoint-GUISyn"},"environments":["cross-platform","desktop","windows","macos","linux","android","ios","web"],"evidence":[{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-19T06:17:16Z","role":"primary","sha256":"74fe1e395b4121dec7ea222d2ee42d1b538f4d7445a2a59158d96d9208af01dd","supports":["name","kind","summary","environments","topics","scope","notes","relations","licenses.data","details.repository_url","details.dataset_profile"],"url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/MolmoPoint-GUIS